flowchart TD
  D[Discovery: request, code and evidence] --> P[Planning: choose depth before drafting]
  P --> M[Contextual shortlist / full catalog / recommendations]
  M --> H[Hardening: reconcile and triage selected reviews]
  H --> A[Preparation: documents, manifest, tracker drafts, implementation plan]
  A --> C{One final bundle confirmation}
  C -->|Approve| E[Execution: detect optional VCS, implement, verify]
  C -->|Revise| P
  C -->|Pause| R[Preserve progress]
  R -->|Resume| C
  U[Native controls → async → chat fallback] -.-> P
  U -.-> C
  S[Pause / resume / reset / restart / drop anytime] -.-> D
  S -.-> A
  F[Suspend: every harness veto disabled] -.-> S
  E --> W[Context-bound delivery / merge decisions]
